  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 203.02 Procedure for Asserting Claim",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 203.02 Procedure for Asserting Claim. Any person submitting information to the department that the person reasonably and in good faith believes constitutes a trade secret as defined in Env-Hw 104 or confidential business information as defined in Env-C 208.03 shall assert a claim of confidentiality with respect to the submitted information in accordance with Env-C 208.04.\n\nSource. #9361-A, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12344-A, eff 8-14-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw200.html"
